{
  "title": { "zh": "训不动的深网", "en": "The deep net that will not train" },
  "tray": "pipeline",
  "after": {
    "zh": "残差连接让输入沿捷径通过，并让卷积分支学习调整量：y = x + F(x)。当目标接近输入时，网络可以从接近原样通过的状态开始，再学习需要的改变。捷径也为梯度提供直接路径，但并不保证所有深层网络都能训练成功。这里的锐化任务本身很简单，不要求每一层都学到不同特征。",
    "en": "A residual connection passes the input along a shortcut and lets the convolution branch learn an adjustment: y = x + F(x). When the target is close to the input, the network can start near the identity and learn the needed change. The shortcut also provides a direct path for gradients, but does not guarantee that every deep network will train successfully. The sharpening task here is simple and does not require every layer to learn a different feature."
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "网络堆得更深，可以让后面的层组合前面的结果，看到更大范围的特征。但层数一多，训练也可能变得困难。",
        "en": "A deeper network can combine earlier results in later layers to see features over a wider area. But as layers accumulate, training can also become difficult."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "先训练两层卷积，观察每一层如何扩大看到的范围。接着尝试训练六层网络，看看怎样让信号通过深层网络。",
        "en": "First train two convolution layers and observe how each expands the area seen. Then try training a six-layer network and see how to help signals travel through it."
      }
    }
  ],
  "unlocks": ["lrn-res"],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "4-16-features",
      "step": { "zh": "学习大范围特征", "en": "Learn a wider feature" },
      "kind": "graph",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "训练两层 3×3 卷积，让输出呈现较大范围的亮度分布。目标等于连续做两次 3×3 平均；先观察亮点测试中，每一层的结果覆盖了多大范围。",
        "en": "Train two 3×3 convolution layers to show brightness over a wider area. The target is two successive 3×3 averages; first observe how wide an area each layer covers in the bright-dot test."
      },
      "hint": {
        "zh": "把两个卷积层串起来，训练它们；比较亮点经过第一层和第二层的图。一个 3×3 层能看到多远，两层又能看到多远？",
        "en": "Connect two convolution layers in sequence and train them. Compare the bright dot after the first and second layers: how far can one 3×3 layer see, and how far can two?"
      },
      "after": {
        "zh": "第一层从附近提取亮度，第二层再组合第一层的结果，因而能看见更大的范围。这里学到的是简单的亮度分布特征；真实网络还可以逐层组合边缘、形状等更复杂的特征。",
        "en": "The first layer extracts nearby brightness, and the second combines those results to see a wider area. Here the learned feature is a simple brightness distribution; real networks can also combine edges, shapes and other more complex features across layers."
      },
      "check": { "tolerance": 0.02 },
      "trainRate": 1,
      "scene": "filter",
      "setup": {
        "target": {
          "correlate": {
            "kernel": [
