    {
      "id": "4-16",
      "step": { "zh": "训练深网", "en": "Train a deep network" },
      "kind": "graph",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "把至少 6 个卷积层串成一条路，训练它做一次轻微的锐化：输出 = 原图 + 0.25 ×（原图 − 3×3 平均）。",
        "en": "Chain at least 6 conv layers into one path and train it to do a light sharpen: output = image + 0.25 × (image − 3×3 average)."
      },
      "hint": {
        "zh": "每层都从很小的随机数开始，图每过一层就缩小几十倍。有没有办法让一层的权重哪怕很小，图也不至于缩没？",
        "en": "Every layer starts from very small random numbers, so the image shrinks tens of times over at each layer. Is there a way for a layer to keep the image from shrinking away even when its weights are tiny?"
      },
      "check": { "tolerance": 0.04 },
      "constraint": { "depth": { "min": 6 } },
      "trainRate": 1,
      "scene": "filter",
      "setup": { "target": { "meanBlend": { "amount": -0.25 } } },
      "tests": [
        { "label": { "zh": "字母 X", "en": "Letter X" }, "in": { "glyph": { "letter": "X" } } },
        { "label": { "zh": "圆盘", "en": "Disc" }, "in": "disk" },
        {
          "label": { "zh": "带噪方块", "en": "Noisy square" },
          "in": { "noisy": { "of": { "square": { "x0": 3, "y0": 5, "s": 7 } }, "seed": 3, "amp": 0.2 } }
        },
        { "label": { "zh": "棋盘", "en": "Checkerboard" }, "in": { "checker": { "cell": 3 } } }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "label": { "zh": "字母 L", "en": "Letter L" },
          "in": { "glyph": { "letter": "L", "lo": 0.2, "hi": 0.8, "ox": 4, "oy": 3 } }
        },
        { "label": { "zh": "竖条纹", "en": "Vertical stripes" }, "in": { "stripes": { "period": 6, "lo": 0.2, "hi": 0.8 } } }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "k0 = lrnConv[w=[-0.027777777777777776, -0.027777777777777776, -0.027777777777777776, -0.027777777777777776, 0.2222222222222222, -0.027777777777777776, -0.027777777777777776, -0.027777777777777776, -0.027777777777777776]](in)",
        "a0 = arith[op=add](in, k0)",
        "k1 = lrnConv[w=[0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]](a0)",
        "a1 = arith[op=add](a0, k1)",
        "k2 = lrnConv[w=[0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]](a1)",
        "a2 = arith[op=add](a1, k2)",
        "k3 = lrnConv[w=[0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]](a2)",
        "a3 = arith[op=add](a2, k3)",
        "k4 = lrnConv[w=[0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]](a3)",
        "a4 = arith[op=add](a3, k4)",
        "k5 = lrnConv[w=[0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]](a4)",
        "a5 = arith[op=add](a4, k5)",
        "out <- a5"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "k0 = lrnConv(in)",
        "k1 = lrnConv(k0)",
